    "summary": "During the [Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase), roll a D6 when a model in Astorath’s unit dies, provided the unit has yet to be picked to fight this phase. Add 1 if the dead model was [engaged](vsdata:core-rule/engagement-range) with a foe whose unit Toughness is at least as high as Astorath’s unit’s. On 4+, leave the model in place until its unit finishes fighting or the phase ends, whichever happens sooner. Otherwise remove it normally.",
